ess likely given absence of epigastric tenderness or typical ulcer-related alarm signs like bleeding)"], "alarm_features": ["Hypertensive crisis (BP 197/128 mmHg)", "Weak lower extremity pulses (possible peripheral vascular disease)", "Obesity and dyslipidemia (increased risk for metabolic complications)"]}, "branches": {"B1": {"id": "B1", "label": "Structural Bowel Obstruction", "parent": "ROOT", "level": 1, "status": "live", "prior": 0.37, "posterior": 0.3016714227476559, "danger": 0.6, "actionability": 0.0, "explanatory_coverage": 0.0, "expand_score": 0.0, "evidence_for": ["Exacerbation patterns with alcohol/fatty meals align with motility disorders, but infectious/structural causes cannot be excluded."], "evidence_against": ["Subacute duration and lack of acute signs moderately argue against structural obstruction, favoring chronic motility issues."], "unresolved_questions": [], "children": [], "closure_reason": "", "turn_cost_to_refine": 2.0, "diagnosis_commitment_gain": 0.8, "interrupt_relevance": 0.4, "level_role": "family", "classification_axis": "mechanism", "representative_diseases": []}, "B2": {"id": "B2", "label": "Motility Disorder", "parent": "ROOT", "level": 1, "status": "expanded", "prior": 0.0, "posterior": 0.5870362821035466, "danger": 0.3, "actionability": 0.0, "explanatory_coverage": 0.0, "expand_score": 0.5, "evidence_for": ["Exacerbation patterns with alcohol/fatty meals align with motility disorders, but infectious/structural causes cannot be excluded."], "evidence_against": [], "unresolved_questions": [], "children": ["B2.1", "B2.2", "B2.3"], "closure_reason": "", "turn_cost_to_refine": 2.0, "diagnosis_commitment_gain": 0.7, "interrupt_relevance": 0.2, "level_role": "family", "classification_axis": "mechanism", "representative_diseases": []}, "B3": {"id": "B3", "label": "Gastrointestinal Infection", "level": 1, "status": "parked", "posterior": 0.06, "danger": 0.5, "parent": "ROOT", "closure_reason": "", "evidence_against": ["The prolonged duration strongly contradicts typical norovirus, moderately weakening gastrointestinal infection."]}, "B4": {"id": "B4", "label": "Vascular Cause (Mesenteric Ischemia)", "level": 1, "status": "closed_for_now", "posterior": 0.015, "danger": 0.9, "parent": "ROOT", "closure_reason": "", "evidence_against": ["Lack of acute signs (e.g., peritonitis) moderately argues against mesenteric ischemia."]}, "B5": {"id": "B5", "label": "Medication-Induced GI Dysfunction", "level": 1, "status": "closed_for_now", "posterior": 0.036, "danger": 0.2, "parent": "ROOT", "closure_reason": "", "evidence_against": []}, "B2.1": {"id": "B2.1", "label": "Diabetic Gastroparesis", "parent": "B2", "level": 2, "status": "live", "prior": 0.30896646426502455, "posterior": 0.30896646426502455, "danger": 0.3, "actionability": 0.0, "explanatory_coverage": 0.0, "expand_score": 0.0, "evidence_for": [], "evidence_against": [], "unresolved_questions": [], "children": [], "closure_reason": "", "turn_cost_to_refine": 1.5, "diagnosis_commitment_gain": 0.6, "interrupt_relevance": 0.3, "level_role": "specific_disease", "classification_axis": "etiology", "representative_diseases": []}, "B2.2": {"id": "B2.2", "label": "Adhesive Small Bowel Obstruction", "parent": "B2", "level": 2, "status": "live", "prior": 0.18537987855901472, "posterior": 0.18537987855901472, "danger": 0.6, "actionability": 0.0, "explanatory_coverage": 0.0, "expand_score": 0.0, "evidence_for": [], "evidence_against": [], "unresolved_questions": [], "children": [], "closure_reason": "", "turn_cost_to_refine": 1.8, "diagnosis_commitment_gain": 0.7, "interrupt_relevance": 0.5, "level_role": "specific_disease", "classification_axis": "anatomy", "representative_diseases": []}, "B2.3": {"id": "B2.3", "label": "Neurogenic Motility Disorder (Enteric Nervous System Damage)", "parent": "B2", "level": 2, "status": "live", "prior": 0.09268993927950736, "posterior": 0.09268993927950736, "danger": 0.4, "actionability": 0.0, "explanatory_coverage": 0.0, "expand